{#- The members copy of the public calculator at /calculadora-de-zonas/.

    Three differences from the public version, all deliberate:
      zcDark    — brand-guidelines.md §7.1: members-area interactive tools are dark.
                  The page chrome is dark too, via members-zones-calculator.css.
                  It previously loaded members.css (the LIGHT content stylesheet),
                  so a dark tool sat inside a white page.
      zcCapture — false. Members already paid; asking for an email to send them a
                  guide their subscription includes would charge them twice for
                  the same thing, once in money and once in friction. The partial
                  renders the download block in that slot instead.
      No prose  — /members/zonas/ and /members/tests/ were retired into this URL
                  on August 13, 2026 and their content was carried across, then
                  removed again the same day: under a working tool it read as
                  unlinked filler. The tool answers the same questions where they
                  are actually asked. Anything that comes back belongs inside the
                  flow, not below it.

    Saved values and re-test history are still NOT here — parked by decision 17
    (zones-calculator-brief.md). Do not add localStorage as a stopgap: it survives
    a return visit but not a device change, and this is a number people re-test
    every 2–3 months for years. -#}
